{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CHARGE!</i> is a laser-tag inspired sport in the future. Athletes are split into teams of three and deployed into a fantastic sci-fi arena to be let loose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A futuristic themed 3v3 multiplayer FPS that blends old-school arena mechanics with modern sensibilities of fun. A fresh take on weapon functionality and gamemode approaches, focusing on the multiplayer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Casual Arena Fun</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With arena-style foundations and a robust 6-player map with lots of room to roam, you can pick your own pace. Huddle close with teammates and stick behind walled cover, or leap into action using the environment to surprise opponents from unpredictable angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Territory Control for the Whole Arena</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/7971f8ab10f77c03690442595017a029.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/7971f8ab10f77c03690442595017a029.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/7971f8ab10f77c03690442595017a029.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a frenzied tug of war, sometimes a game of distraction... and sometimes curious wandering, Path Command is the objective game mode of Charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory is split into multiple zones on the map, held by the Command Lines that can snake and wind around the terrain in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This brings players into combat situations not normally seen with the more common objective zones, and we hope this gives you and your team a variety of ways to play, whether you're on attack and aiming for capture, or a defender tasked with staying in command to win. And, don't sweat it if your strategy doesn't work out, matches are short, so just run it back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Laser weapons you wish you could play with</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/0b20da2b2d49b100933776c1911d002b.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" aria-label=\"Trusty Rifle, modified with Prism Passthrough\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/0b20da2b2d49b100933776c1911d002b.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/0b20da2b2d49b100933776c1911d002b.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/da11fdaf6636521e8c74c01655b0a01c.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" aria-label=\"Letloose SMG, modified with Rebound\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/da11fdaf6636521e8c74c01655b0a01c.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/da11fdaf6636521e8c74c01655b0a01c.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/933c8b1ae035cff020206cb3ddda8dc5.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" aria-label=\"Shotbrite Lite, modified with Rebound\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/933c8b1ae035cff020206cb3ddda8dc5.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/933c8b1ae035cff020206cb3ddda8dc5.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With laser tag comes laser weapons, but why not push them as far as they can go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this effort, whether you want strategy or shenanigans, modifier pickups that bring out a laser's reflective abilities and more are waiting in the arena for you to test out at your own discretion. Just be careful if your teammates are in the path of your experiments...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/5357f4fb37b4a99a69bc51c944968d41.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" aria-label=\"Trusty Rifle, modified with Hazard Trail\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/5357f4fb37b4a99a69bc51c944968d41.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/5357f4fb37b4a99a69bc51c944968d41.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903980?t=1766262413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/532deedf913ffbd1db2d693b9f3d5d363c7f731c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766262413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/04a469e2bfe897576c25ddb2aabe3fdae33a987f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766262413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/04a469e2bfe897576c25ddb2aabe3fdae33a987f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766262413","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CHARGE!</i> is a laser-tag inspired sport in the future. Athletes are split into teams of three and deployed into a fantastic sci-fi arena to be let loose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A futuristic themed 3v3 multiplayer FPS that blends old-school arena mechanics with modern sensibilities of fun. A fresh take on weapon functionality and gamemode approaches, focusing on the multiplayer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Casual Arena Fun</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With arena-style foundations and a robust 6-player map with lots of room to roam, you can pick your own pace. Huddle close with teammates and stick behind walled cover, or leap into action using the environment to surprise opponents from unpredictable angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Territory Control for the Whole Arena</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/7971f8ab10f77c03690442595017a029.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/7971f8ab10f77c03690442595017a029.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/7971f8ab10f77c03690442595017a029.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a frenzied tug of war, sometimes a game of distraction... and sometimes curious wandering, Path Command is the objective game mode of Charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory is split into multiple zones on the map, held by the Command Lines that can snake and wind around the terrain in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This brings players into combat situations not normally seen with the more common objective zones, and we hope this gives you and your team a variety of ways to play, whether you're on attack and aiming for capture, or a defender tasked with staying in command to win. And, don't sweat it if your strategy doesn't work out, matches are short, so just run it back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Laser weapons you wish you could play with</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/0b20da2b2d49b100933776c1911d002b.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" aria-label=\"Trusty Rifle, modified with Prism Passthrough\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/0b20da2b2d49b100933776c1911d002b.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/0b20da2b2d49b100933776c1911d002b.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/da11fdaf6636521e8c74c01655b0a01c.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" aria-label=\"Letloose SMG, modified with Rebound\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/da11fdaf6636521e8c74c01655b0a01c.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/da11fdaf6636521e8c74c01655b0a01c.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/933c8b1ae035cff020206cb3ddda8dc5.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" aria-label=\"Shotbrite Lite, modified with Rebound\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/933c8b1ae035cff020206cb3ddda8dc5.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/933c8b1ae035cff020206cb3ddda8dc5.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With laser tag comes laser weapons, but why not push them as far as they can go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this effort, whether you want strategy or shenanigans, modifier pickups that bring out a laser's reflective abilities and more are waiting in the arena for you to test out at your own discretion. Just be careful if your teammates are in the path of your experiments...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/5357f4fb37b4a99a69bc51c944968d41.poster.avif?t=1766262413\" aria-label=\"Trusty Rifle, modified with Hazard Trail\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/5357f4fb37b4a99a69bc51c944968d41.webm?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/5357f4fb37b4a99a69bc51c944968d41.mp4?t=1766262413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Honor Games\u00ae"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/b170e497dc0f5e051af9c8cd6edfdc3fe6139e36/header.jpg?t=1766262413","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2021-2025 Honor Games. All Rights Reserved.<br><strong>\"Honor Games\" </strong>is a  registered Trademark in the United States.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903980/643518250/96a7165f2a4a2c8551dfb920ca1104f55d3804b4/1766103122/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766262412","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903980/643518250/96a7165f2a4a2c8551dfb920ca1104f55d3804b4/1766103122/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766262412","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903980/643518250/96a7165f2a4a2c8551dfb920ca1104f55d3804b4/1766103122/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766262412","id":257252377,"name":"Charge! Release Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257252377/1a8b6f2466031ef7b6a607964e2db17f3d8fec47/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766262412"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903980/1669500532/dffb2403e6677c9795861a0832f84687b0eb2854/1763535548/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763536487","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903980/1669500532/dffb2403e6677c9795861a0832f84687b0eb2854/1763535548/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763536487","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903980/1669500532/dffb2403e6677c97